    "summary": "Spend 1 CP in your Shooting phase. Pick one IMPERIAL KNIGHTS unit of yours not yet chosen to shoot this phase. For the rest of the phase, its models may shoot [BLAST] weapons at enemy units within its Engagement Range, but only when no other friendly unit is in Engagement Range of the enemy unit being targeted. Also for the rest of the phase, the unit ignores the Hit roll penalty that applies while it is within Engagement Range of enemy units; however, each [BLAST] weapon attack against a unit within its Engagement Range that rolls an unmodified 1 to hit inflicts 1 mortal wound on the IMPERIAL KNIGHTS unit, resolved once all its attacks are done.",
